# pop'n music 13 Carnival: test mode > NETWORK OPTIONS (item 8) > e-AMUSEMENT OPTIONS > e-AMUSEMENT ON,
# SAVE AND EXIT (the menus open slowly and start the cursor on EXIT). Then power cycle; run
# oracle/scripts/popn13-card-new.his with the same --nvram.
#   hiraku-popn13 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn13-eamuse-on.his
game popn13
at 3000 press "Test" 10
at 3300 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3320 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3340 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3360 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3380 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3400 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3420 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3440 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3520 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3720 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3760 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4160 snap
at 4170 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4200 hold "P1 Button 5"
at 4220 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4250 release "P1 Button 5"
at 4280 snap
at 4300 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4330 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4360 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4390 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4420 snap
at 4440 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4700 snap
at 4710 quit
